{"id":"efe7e0230be5eab5","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-model-standard-system.md","title":"ZFC Model Standard System","display":"df-zfc-model-standard-system — ZFC Model Standard System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model-standard-system","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model-standard-system","58-df-zfc-model8-standard-system"],"display":"df-zfc-model-standard-system — ZFC Model Standard System","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-model]]","[[58-df-set]]","[[58-df-zfc-set-transitive-set]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model-standard-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model-standard-system</span><span>58-df-zfc-model8-standard-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model-standard-system — ZFC Model Standard System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"58-df-model\">58-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1e75cf0c92655d78\" href=\"?note=1e75cf0c92655d78\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set-transitive-set\">58-df-zfc-set-transitive-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in V\">\\(M\\in V\\)</span> (model)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\)</span> (standard-system candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> (ambient first-order axiom set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModelStandardSystem}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModelStandardSystem}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel8StandardSystem}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel8StandardSystem}_S\\)</span> (merged predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSetTransitiveSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSetTransitiveSet}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}\\)</span> (transitive-set and two-place model predicates)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}standard\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModelStandardSystem}_S(S,M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcSetTransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Model}(\\langle M,\\in\\cap(M\\times M)\\rangle,\\mathrm{ZFC})\\land S=\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\cap M\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}standard\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModelStandardSystem}_S(S,M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcSetTransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Model}(\\langle M,\\in\\cap(M\\times M)\\rangle,\\mathrm{ZFC})\\land S=\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\cap M\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}standard\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel8StandardSystem}_S(S,M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcModelStandardSystem}_S(S,M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}standard\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel8StandardSystem}_S(S,M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcModelStandardSystem}_S(S,M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This trace presentation is restricted to transitive ZFC set models; its standard real trace is exactly the subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> that belong to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The model8 name is a direct alias of the canonical predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"923884eb8fe4e61d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set-transitive-set","status":"resolved","id":"1e75cf0c92655d78","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-set-transitive-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModelStandardSystem}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel8StandardSystem}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSetTransitiveSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Model}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}standard\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModelStandardSystem}_S(S,M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcSetTransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Model}(\\langle M,\\in\\cap(M\\times M)\\rangle,\\mathrm{ZFC})\\land S=\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\cap M","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}standard\\text{-}system} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModel8StandardSystem}_S(S,M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcModelStandardSystem}_S(S,M)","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":1502,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2712","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-model-standard-system.md|58-df-zfc-model-standard-system]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","923884eb8fe4e61d","65d9a1e690c32aad","1e75cf0c92655d78","8b6a90316aad78a4"]}